sequenceDiagram
    participant U as Uploader
    participant S as Storage
    participant I as Indexer
    participant N as Notifier
    par to the store
        U->>S: put object
    and to the index
        U->>I: queue for indexing
    end
    critical reach the store
        S-->>U: 201 created
    option timeout
        S-->>U: retry later
    option no space left
        S-->>U: 507 refused
    end
    break quota reached
        U->>N: warn the owner
    end
